      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think I found out what's causing this. There's an asset on the avatar that has many different material swaps. When I remove the material swapping, then this bug doesn't occur.\n\nA separate tool confirmed that the avatar actually uses 183MB of texture memory, so it does belong in Very Poor. It's the SDK that is wrong here. The server-side performance rank is correct, but for some reason, it isn't getting applied everywhere it needs to.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
